(5067070, 739510, 60173, '<td valign="top">This could use a run through Neat Image or similar. Very well executed otherwise. I like the centered square crop choice, but I don''t like the beveled border. I''ve got a personal angst against beveling, but I''m not voting, so it won''t hurt your score from me.</td>', 'This could use a run through Neat Image or similar. Very well executed otherwise. I like the centered square crop choice, but I don''t like the beveled border. I''ve got a personal angst against beveling, but I''m not voting, so it won''t hurt your score from me.', '2008-11-17 00:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5067072, 739565, 28322, '<td valign="top">wonderful composition and great idea, 8 from me :)</td>', 'wonderful composition and great idea, 8 from me :)', '2008-11-17 00:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5067076, 739681, 90495, '<td valign="top">... Lovely image.</td>', '... Lovely image.', '2008-11-17 00:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5067078, 739216, 90495, '<td valign="top">Woah, at first glance I thought I was looking at a b&amp;w shot of prairies with a huge mug. lol I like this composition.</td>', 'Woah, at first glance I thought I was looking at a b&w shot of prairies with a huge mug. lol I like this composition.', '2008-11-17 00:14:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5067080, 739676, 33352, '<td valign="top">What a find totally amazing composition and the colors are intriguing...10</td>', 'What a find totally amazing composition and the colors are intriguing...10', '2008-11-17 00:17:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5067082, 739370, 90495, '<td valign="top">Me too. :D</td>', 'Me too. :D', '2008-11-17 00:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5067083, 739160, 60173, '<td valign="top">Shots like this are best done outside under natural light or well controled studio lighting. It looks like your white balance wasn''t set properly for your indoor lighting.<br/> <br/>The focus is good, but I can''t say it''s a terribly interesting subject. You probably would have been better off pulling back and getting something else in the shot too; bowl, spoon, etc. <br/> <br/>Our instinct is to zoom in and focus on our subject rather than let the subject speak for itself. I''m a huge macro fan, so I''m struggling the same battle. If the scene is set up properly your subject will pop out on its own.<br/> <br/>This is one of my favorite learning shots on the site. One day I''ll get it right!<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=412232" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/569/120/412232.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/569/120/412232.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/569/120/412232.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Shots like this are best done outside under natural light or well controled studio lighting. It looks like your white balance wasn''t set properly for your indoor lighting. The focus is good, but I can''t say it''s a terribly interesting subject. You probably would have been better off pulling back and getting something else in the shot too; bowl, spoon, etc.  Our instinct is to zoom in and focus on our subject rather than let the subject speak for itself. I''m a huge macro fan, so I''m struggling the same battle. If the scene is set up properly your subject will pop out on its own. This is one of my favorite learning shots on the site. One day I''ll get it right! ', '2008-11-17 00:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5067084, 739160, 73564, '<td valign="top">Composition is good, but the lighting and white ballance is going to hurt the score. Focus is good. (no vote)</td>', 'Composition is good, but the lighting and white ballance is going to hurt the score. Focus is good. (no vote)', '2008-11-17 00:20:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5067085, 739628, 90495, '<td valign="top">Imagination will often carry us to worlds that never were. But without it we go nowhere.<br/>Carl Sagan <br/> <br/>This is galactic.</td>', 'Imagination will often carry us to worlds that never were. But without it we go nowhere.Carl Sagan  This is galactic.', '2008-11-17 00:20:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5067086, 739175, 90495, '<td valign="top">yes it does.</td>', 'yes it does.', '2008-11-17 00:20:58.000000', NULL, 1),
