(5067090, 739687, 60173, '<td valign="top">I can see why you did the selective desaturation, but unfortunately you missed large chunks and in this venue you''re going to get hammered for being sloppy. I think you''re too close to your subject and that is limiting your framing and cropping options. You can see the heart fairly clearly from the thumbnail, but at full size I''m looking at the pretty bark patterns.</td>', 'I can see why you did the selective desaturation, but unfortunately you missed large chunks and in this venue you''re going to get hammered for being sloppy. I think you''re too close to your subject and that is limiting your framing and cropping options. You can see the heart fairly clearly from the thumbnail, but at full size I''m looking at the pretty bark patterns.', '2008-11-17 00:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
