(5067114, 739461, 60173, '<td valign="top">Beautiful girl and good idea, but it looks like you dodged her eyes a bit too much. <br/> <br/>The background in the bottom right of the photo is getting pretty yellow. If you''re going to have a white background on this site, it''s gotta be white, white. Since it''s an Advanced challenge, you can just mask her head out to select all except her head and then desaturate the yellows in Hue/Saturation.</td>', 'Beautiful girl and good idea, but it looks like you dodged her eyes a bit too much.  The background in the bottom right of the photo is getting pretty yellow. If you''re going to have a white background on this site, it''s gotta be white, white. Since it''s an Advanced challenge, you can just mask her head out to select all except her head and then desaturate the yellows in Hue/Saturation.', '2008-11-17 00:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5067115, 739565, 36619, '<td valign="top">super cute idea!</td>', 'super cute idea!', '2008-11-17 00:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5067116, 739527, 60224, '<td valign="top">NO!</td>', 'NO!', '2008-11-17 00:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5067118, 739386, 60224, '<td valign="top">Great shot. I want to get better at these types of shots.</td>', 'Great shot. I want to get better at these types of shots.', '2008-11-17 00:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5067122, 739216, 76430, '<td valign="top">Is that an "I Love San Diego" mug?  Extra point for that. ;-) Otherwise, I love the cell shadow but it may have been better to have the subject, the mug,out of the shadow.  The carpeting in the cell is pretty unrealistic.</td>', 'Is that an "I Love San Diego" mug?  Extra point for that. ;-) Otherwise, I love the cell shadow but it may have been better to have the subject, the mug,out of the shadow.  The carpeting in the cell is pretty unrealistic.', '2008-11-17 00:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5067124, 739698, 60173, '<td valign="top">I do like the idea and the overall outcome of the shot, but I think your vignette is a bit too tight or the image is too dark as a whole. <br/> <br/>I can see how your artistic intent might be to have the strong darkness, but coupled with the muted colors it would be easy to pass this image over without noticing it.<br/> <br/>I wonder if you could have cloned out that pole running through your "I".</td>', 'I do like the idea and the overall outcome of the shot, but I think your vignette is a bit too tight or the image is too dark as a whole.  I can see how your artistic intent might be to have the strong darkness, but coupled with the muted colors it would be easy to pass this image over without noticing it. I wonder if you could have cloned out that pole running through your "I".', '2008-11-17 00:45:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5067125, 739371, 60173, '<td valign="top">I see the heart, but most of all I see a photo that hasn''t been flipped to the correct orientation. It might have been better to flip it horizontal and let the viewer find the sideways heart.</td>', 'I see the heart, but most of all I see a photo that hasn''t been flipped to the correct orientation. It might have been better to flip it horizontal and let the viewer find the sideways heart.', '2008-11-17 00:46:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5067126, 739668, 60224, '<td valign="top">That''s just creepy! But I can''t stop looking at it!! She has wild eyes!</td>', 'That''s just creepy! But I can''t stop looking at it!! She has wild eyes!', '2008-11-17 00:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5067128, 739702, 63812, '<td valign="top">amazing! 10</td>', 'amazing! 10', '2008-11-17 00:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5067130, 739715, 18655, '<td valign="top">Nice golden hue on this. Great title for the scene. Great photo!</td>', 'Nice golden hue on this. Great title for the scene. Great photo!', '2008-11-17 00:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5067131, 738997, 60173, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous portrait. Those eyes are amazing. There''s a lot of depth here. There''s so much to look at, because it''s all so well done.</td>', 'Gorgeous portrait. Those eyes are amazing. There''s a lot of depth here. There''s so much to look at, because it''s all so well done.', '2008-11-17 00:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5067133, 739313, 18655, '<td valign="top">I can see the heart clearly - cool!</td>', 'I can see the heart clearly - cool!', '2008-11-17 00:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5067136, 739664, 60173, '<td valign="top">I like your composition choice. I love the hair and the lighting behind the ears. <br/> <br/>It looks as though you may have bad your focus off a bit, and I think you could have bumped up the brightness a few notches and still got the same dark effect.</td>', 'I like your composition choice. I love the hair and the lighting behind the ears.  It looks as though you may have bad your focus off a bit, and I think you could have bumped up the brightness a few notches and still got the same dark effect.', '2008-11-17 00:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5067138, 739307, 18655, '<td valign="top">Great idea and a nice macro. Looks good in b/w and composition looks good although I feel the legs may have been cut of a little.</td>', 'Great idea and a nice macro. Looks good in b/w and composition looks good although I feel the legs may have been cut of a little.', '2008-11-17 00:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5067139, 739723, 60173, '<td valign="top">This is honestly pretty interesting even though I have no idea what I''m really looking at.</td>', 'This is honestly pretty interesting even though I have no idea what I''m really looking at.', '2008-11-17 00:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5067140, 739545, 18655, '<td valign="top">Interesting and an artsy view with a good combination of colors</td>', 'Interesting and an artsy view with a good combination of colors', '2008-11-17 00:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5067141, 739676, 96915, '<td valign="top">This is gorgeous!  I love the trails in the sand and how they form around the rock.  Great find!</td>', 'This is gorgeous!  I love the trails in the sand and how they form around the rock.  Great find!', '2008-11-17 00:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5067143, 738727, 18655, '<td valign="top">lots of negative space but looks OK.</td>', 'lots of negative space but looks OK.', '2008-11-17 00:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5067145, 739719, 96915, '<td valign="top">A punny play on words that actually works.  The lighting is quite nice and the heart looks casual yet deliberate.</td>', 'A punny play on words that actually works.  The lighting is quite nice and the heart looks casual yet deliberate.', '2008-11-17 00:58:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5067148, 739531, 18655, '<td valign="top">Is that ginger cookie? :) Looks good but the cookie should have been in focus or removed if it was impossible.</td>', 'Is that ginger cookie? :) Looks good but the cookie should have been in focus or removed if it was impossible.', '2008-11-17 00:59:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5067150, 739543, 96915, '<td valign="top">Great capture and the only deck of cards in the whole bunch of entries (that I''ve seen so far)</td>', 'Great capture and the only deck of cards in the whole bunch of entries (that I''ve seen so far)', '2008-11-17 01:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5067154, 739616, 18655, '<td valign="top">I''m glad you didn''t only take a picture of the heart as many others would have done. The cool blue background adds a lot and makes t look like an ice heart. Very cool effect and a beautiful composition!</td>', 'I''m glad you didn''t only take a picture of the heart as many others would have done. The cool blue background adds a lot and makes t look like an ice heart. Very cool effect and a beautiful composition!', '2008-11-17 01:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5067155, 739307, 60173, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot, but you cut off his little toes! Did you do that pre or post process? If you did it post you would have been better off leaving whatever he was standing on in the shot I think.</td>', 'Lovely shot, but you cut off his little toes! Did you do that pre or post process? If you did it post you would have been better off leaving whatever he was standing on in the shot I think.', '2008-11-17 01:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5067156, 739681, 18655, '<td valign="top">I really like this! Great idea and an amazing result. I wish though that the ''heart'' hadn''t been smack dab in the middle.</td>', 'I really like this! Great idea and an amazing result. I wish though that the ''heart'' hadn''t been smack dab in the middle.', '2008-11-17 01:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5067157, 739565, 96915, '<td valign="top">Having looked at the image first and not the title, I have to confess that I was a little confused about what hearts have to do with feet, but liked it nonetheless.  Makes sense now that I read the title :P</td>', 'Having looked at the image first and not the title, I have to confess that I was a little confused about what hearts have to do with feet, but liked it nonetheless.  Makes sense now that I read the title :P', '2008-11-17 01:03:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5067158, 739673, 18655, '<td valign="top">Great idea and a good choice of color. The only thing I could complain about is that IMO it shouldn''t have faded quite as much in the top left corner. A smoother transition would have been better for me.</td>', 'Great idea and a good choice of color. The only thing I could complain about is that IMO it shouldn''t have faded quite as much in the top left corner. A smoother transition would have been better for me.', '2008-11-17 01:04:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5067159, 739697, 18655, '<td valign="top">Great idea! Good colors and interesting to look at.</td>', 'Great idea! Good colors and interesting to look at.', '2008-11-17 01:05:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5067160, 739216, 18655, '<td valign="top">Everything about this is simple but you made it look good.</td>', 'Everything about this is simple but you made it look good.', '2008-11-17 01:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5067161, 738844, 18655, '<td valign="top">Lots of hearts :)</td>', 'Lots of hearts :)', '2008-11-17 01:06:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5067162, 739625, 18655, '<td valign="top">Good balance and a nice golden hue</td>', 'Good balance and a nice golden hue', '2008-11-17 01:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5067163, 739160, 96915, '<td valign="top">Focus is nice and crisp.  I''d have liked to see a bit more Wow factor.  The colors are so close that the heart doesn''t really stand out on its own.</td>', 'Focus is nice and crisp.  I''d have liked to see a bit more Wow factor.  The colors are so close that the heart doesn''t really stand out on its own.', '2008-11-17 01:07:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5067164, 739583, 54478, '<td valign="top">I like this photo, but I feel that that this style has been over played. Good composition, but I the lighting came from one direction.</td>', 'I like this photo, but I feel that that this style has been over played. Good composition, but I the lighting came from one direction.', '2008-11-17 01:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5067165, 739421, 96915, '<td valign="top">I find selective de-saturation to be a bit gimmicky, and even more so in a heart challenge.  Also, the white flowers seem to be the brightest part of the image, which distracts a bit.</td>', 'I find selective de-saturation to be a bit gimmicky, and even more so in a heart challenge.  Also, the white flowers seem to be the brightest part of the image, which distracts a bit.', '2008-11-17 01:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5067166, 738997, 54478, '<td valign="top">Beautiful eyes.</td>', 'Beautiful eyes.', '2008-11-17 01:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5067169, 739668, 18655, '<td valign="top">Nasty! But good job conveying the message. White on white is not easy but it looks like you pulled it off although on my monitor it looks like there might be some burned out areas.<br/>The fiery red hair looks very good in this shot.</td>', 'Nasty! But good job conveying the message. White on white is not easy but it looks like you pulled it off although on my monitor it looks like there might be some burned out areas.The fiery red hair looks very good in this shot.', '2008-11-17 01:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
