(5067420, 739670, 51793, '<td valign="top">I think your lighting is wrong here... <br/>A Levels Adjustment or adjusting the Exposure would have helped here. I''m not sure how you shot this with the lighting an all but it looks like you just used ambient lighting from the room. If you have a flash you could bounce it off the ceiling and it would give you some better light. OR... take a desk lamp and hover your object but place a sheet of white printer paper between the light and the object to diffuse it.</td>', 'I think your lighting is wrong here... A Levels Adjustment or adjusting the Exposure would have helped here. I''m not sure how you shot this with the lighting an all but it looks like you just used ambient lighting from the room. If you have a flash you could bounce it off the ceiling and it would give you some better light. OR... take a desk lamp and hover your object but place a sheet of white printer paper between the light and the object to diffuse it.', '2008-11-17 07:26:10.000000', NULL, 1),
