(5068009, 739510, 98141, '<td valign="top">Nice dof, nice colors. Would prefer if the subject wasn''t right in the middle.</td>', 'Nice dof, nice colors. Would prefer if the subject wasn''t right in the middle.', '2008-11-17 13:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5068010, 739717, 98141, '<td valign="top">Aw, they all look so sad, and then you can see the photographer snapping pics, lol.<br/> <br/>I suppose your title means that you have to have heart?<br/> <br/>I wish the half-bicycle wasn''t in the frame on the right.</td>', 'Aw, they all look so sad, and then you can see the photographer snapping pics, lol. I suppose your title means that you have to have heart? I wish the half-bicycle wasn''t in the frame on the right.', '2008-11-17 13:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5068011, 739527, 98141, '<td valign="top">Hate to say it, but I don''t get it. What''s the event? Heart surgery? If you PM me with an explanation, I''ll be happy to be more constructive, but I won''t score it differently out of fairness to the others.</td>', 'Hate to say it, but I don''t get it. What''s the event? Heart surgery? If you PM me with an explanation, I''ll be happy to be more constructive, but I won''t score it differently out of fairness to the others.', '2008-11-17 13:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5068012, 739482, 98141, '<td valign="top">Hahaha, and the dog is wearing a sweater, this is hilarious.</td>', 'Hahaha, and the dog is wearing a sweater, this is hilarious.', '2008-11-17 13:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5068013, 739676, 9576, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo with or with out the stone 9</td>', 'This is a great photo with or with out the stone 9', '2008-11-17 13:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5068035, 739530, 76598, '<td valign="top">nice image, well exposed, well light, it strikes me as a little dark, but other than that it is great.</td>', 'nice image, well exposed, well light, it strikes me as a little dark, but other than that it is great.', '2008-11-17 13:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5068037, 739307, 76598, '<td valign="top">Where are the legs....strikes me as a little odd without legs.  I like the idea and a nice image, but a little flat....but the heart might not come out in color.</td>', 'Where are the legs....strikes me as a little odd without legs.  I like the idea and a nice image, but a little flat....but the heart might not come out in color.', '2008-11-17 13:48:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5068046, 739591, 76598, '<td valign="top">The multiple layers of hearts are very nice, although I think single rings might have been better than the spiral.  I also not sure where the pattern in the paper fits, finally a tighter crop without the vignette would have been better.</td>', 'The multiple layers of hearts are very nice, although I think single rings might have been better than the spiral.  I also not sure where the pattern in the paper fits, finally a tighter crop without the vignette would have been better.', '2008-11-17 14:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5068053, 739665, 76598, '<td valign="top">Great idea, I really like the double reflection of the heart.  I find it a little dark and not as crisp as I would like (perhaps the material involved) and the light to the right needed a shoot through umbrella and maybe a double mask.</td>', 'Great idea, I really like the double reflection of the heart.  I find it a little dark and not as crisp as I would like (perhaps the material involved) and the light to the right needed a shoot through umbrella and maybe a double mask.', '2008-11-17 14:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5068056, 739664, 67152, '<td valign="top">lovely subdued processing - not  a fan of tattoos but in this specific environment it works very well</td>', 'lovely subdued processing - not  a fan of tattoos but in this specific environment it works very well', '2008-11-17 14:09:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5068057, 739586, 67152, '<td valign="top">the theme, the title, the shadow - it all works very well together - i just wish the shadow was a bit less noisy</td>', 'the theme, the title, the shadow - it all works very well together - i just wish the shadow was a bit less noisy', '2008-11-17 14:09:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5068058, 739510, 76598, '<td valign="top">Excellent, love the color....though some may have wanted red...love the reflection, the background works well, just a wonderful image.</td>', 'Excellent, love the color....though some may have wanted red...love the reflection, the background works well, just a wonderful image.', '2008-11-17 14:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5068059, 739687, 67152, '<td valign="top">a creative find visually - the textures of the tree are so fantastic</td>', 'a creative find visually - the textures of the tree are so fantastic', '2008-11-17 14:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5068060, 739666, 76598, '<td valign="top">nice idea, a little dark and it doesn''t have any snap</td>', 'nice idea, a little dark and it doesn''t have any snap', '2008-11-17 14:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5068061, 739669, 76598, '<td valign="top">I like the image, good colors, I like the DOF, but where is the heart?</td>', 'I like the image, good colors, I like the DOF, but where is the heart?', '2008-11-17 14:11:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5068063, 739565, 76598, '<td valign="top">Very cute, I like the way the jeans fade to black, this will be a high score image.....no complaints from me on it.  I think the far left foot needs washing :)</td>', 'Very cute, I like the way the jeans fade to black, this will be a high score image.....no complaints from me on it.  I think the far left foot needs washing :)', '2008-11-17 14:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5068065, 739566, 76598, '<td valign="top">Cute idea, cute idea, well exposed, excellent color....very nice image</td>', 'Cute idea, cute idea, well exposed, excellent color....very nice image', '2008-11-17 14:12:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5068066, 738727, 76598, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a little dark and it lacks snap, I would like to see the heart further into the image.</td>', 'Perhaps a little dark and it lacks snap, I would like to see the heart further into the image.', '2008-11-17 14:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5068068, 739698, 67152, '<td valign="top">nice use of motion blur to emphasize the world in motion</td>', 'nice use of motion blur to emphasize the world in motion', '2008-11-17 14:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5068070, 739613, 67152, '<td valign="top">a really nice studio effort - clean and simple and direct</td>', 'a really nice studio effort - clean and simple and direct', '2008-11-17 14:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5068071, 739673, 76598, '<td valign="top">Very nice, I typically don''t care for abstract images, but this one works.  I am not sure about the extent of light/dark changes across the image.  It almost fades to white on the top left and to black on the bottom right....a more subtle and less extensive change might have been better....but a high score for this one.</td>', 'Very nice, I typically don''t care for abstract images, but this one works.  I am not sure about the extent of light/dark changes across the image.  It almost fades to white on the top left and to black on the bottom right....a more subtle and less extensive change might have been better....but a high score for this one.', '2008-11-17 14:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5068073, 739609, 76598, '<td valign="top">gruesome, you get points for creativity, but otherwise this doesn''t really appeal to me.  The technicals (exposure, light, DOF, etc) are good</td>', 'gruesome, you get points for creativity, but otherwise this doesn''t really appeal to me.  The technicals (exposure, light, DOF, etc) are good', '2008-11-17 14:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5068075, 739562, 76598, '<td valign="top">Interesting, for me the glare on the leaf isn''t too appealing, the "dizziness" of the surrounding also make my head spin.</td>', 'Interesting, for me the glare on the leaf isn''t too appealing, the "dizziness" of the surrounding also make my head spin.', '2008-11-17 14:17:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5068077, 739718, 76598, '<td valign="top">Very cute, nice capture, well light, good color....little to complain about with this one....good high score</td>', 'Very cute, nice capture, well light, good color....little to complain about with this one....good high score', '2008-11-17 14:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5068078, 739206, 76598, '<td valign="top">A little flat and lacking in contrast, does the shirt mean something relative to the heart....perhaps missing that.</td>', 'A little flat and lacking in contrast, does the shirt mean something relative to the heart....perhaps missing that.', '2008-11-17 14:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5068080, 739634, 76598, '<td valign="top">nice color, but it seems to lack depth in the image and the depth of field (although it is shot straight on) seems too shallow</td>', 'nice color, but it seems to lack depth in the image and the depth of field (although it is shot straight on) seems too shallow', '2008-11-17 14:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5068082, 739676, 76598, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image, I love the color, patterns and composition.  This is a sure winner....BUT there are several really strong images in this competition.  Good Luck   I''d love to know where you found the pattern and in what.</td>', 'Wonderful image, I love the color, patterns and composition.  This is a sure winner....BUT there are several really strong images in this competition.  Good Luck   I''d love to know where you found the pattern and in what.', '2008-11-17 14:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5068083, 739698, 76598, '<td valign="top">Taking a chance!  Cute idea and i get the meaning....the image strike me as a little dark and perhaps too flat.</td>', 'Taking a chance!  Cute idea and i get the meaning....the image strike me as a little dark and perhaps too flat.', '2008-11-17 14:21:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5068100, 739580, 30861, '<td valign="top">Thanx :-)</td>', 'Thanx :-)', '2008-11-17 14:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5068104, 739697, 67152, '<td valign="top">a great concept and well delivered</td>', 'a great concept and well delivered', '2008-11-17 14:42:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5068121, 739629, 76598, '<td valign="top">Nice image, I like the red infused into the middle of the heart, it strikes me as a little dark though and a smooth ring might have rendered a crisper heart</td>', 'Nice image, I like the red infused into the middle of the heart, it strikes me as a little dark though and a smooth ring might have rendered a crisper heart', '2008-11-17 14:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5068126, 739719, 76598, '<td valign="top">nice, it is a pleasing image, I think it may suffer relative to others because there are some strong images in this competition.  It seems to lack a crispness that some of the others have.</td>', 'nice, it is a pleasing image, I think it may suffer relative to others because there are some strong images in this competition.  It seems to lack a crispness that some of the others have.', '2008-11-17 15:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5068128, 739482, 76598, '<td valign="top">Cute, the focus seems a little soft and the background a bit bland, the shadows are a little strong.</td>', 'Cute, the focus seems a little soft and the background a bit bland, the shadows are a little strong.', '2008-11-17 15:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5068130, 739690, 76598, '<td valign="top">Good use of lighting, though there are areas that appear blown out and my sense is that there may be too much negative space that does not add to the image.</td>', 'Good use of lighting, though there are areas that appear blown out and my sense is that there may be too much negative space that does not add to the image.', '2008-11-17 15:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5068132, 738844, 76598, '<td valign="top">I like the drawer pulls and the heart in the chains, color, focus and lighting are good.  I guess the biggest killer for me is the background behind the chains...just not working for me.</td>', 'I like the drawer pulls and the heart in the chains, color, focus and lighting are good.  I guess the biggest killer for me is the background behind the chains...just not working for me.', '2008-11-17 15:08:10.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5068134, 739475, 76598, '<td valign="top">nice idea, but somehow the texture of the light area is uneven and unpleasant.</td>', 'nice idea, but somehow the texture of the light area is uneven and unpleasant.', '2008-11-17 15:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5068136, 739371, 76598, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture and there are hearts here, but I fear you may be challenged for a bit of a shoehorn.....really nice picture (if upright), but the angle just messes with my mind.</td>', 'Very nice picture and there are hearts here, but I fear you may be challenged for a bit of a shoehorn.....really nice picture (if upright), but the angle just messes with my mind.', '2008-11-17 15:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5068140, 739579, 76598, '<td valign="top">Very interesting, I like the lighting, the texture of the image, wonderful color.  The reflection being on top is a bit bothersome to me.  If the image were the same and the reflection below this would be a very high scoring image.</td>', 'Very interesting, I like the lighting, the texture of the image, wonderful color.  The reflection being on top is a bit bothersome to me.  If the image were the same and the reflection below this would be a very high scoring image.', '2008-11-17 15:12:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5068142, 739205, 76598, '<td valign="top">I am afraid I have missed the point on this one....where is the heart, it is too abstract to understand the intent.</td>', 'I am afraid I have missed the point on this one....where is the heart, it is too abstract to understand the intent.', '2008-11-17 15:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5068144, 739527, 76598, '<td valign="top">I am sorry, I just don''t find this image....or the title....appealing</td>', 'I am sorry, I just don''t find this image....or the title....appealing', '2008-11-17 15:14:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5068145, 739580, 76598, '<td valign="top">Very cute, colorful, good composition....your only problem is some very strong competition in this challenge</td>', 'Very cute, colorful, good composition....your only problem is some very strong competition in this challenge', '2008-11-17 15:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5068147, 739667, 76598, '<td valign="top">Nice bright image with good contrast against the background, I like it, good composition.  What is the white debris to the left of the left bear?</td>', 'Nice bright image with good contrast against the background, I like it, good composition.  What is the white debris to the left of the left bear?', '2008-11-17 15:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5068148, 739531, 76598, '<td valign="top">Since there are several images like this in the competition, it is going to be tough for you.  The second heart (in front) is too coarse and out of focus to be of value in the image.  I am not sure what you did to the text, but I am not sure it appeals to me.</td>', 'Since there are several images like this in the competition, it is going to be tough for you.  The second heart (in front) is too coarse and out of focus to be of value in the image.  I am not sure what you did to the text, but I am not sure it appeals to me.', '2008-11-17 15:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5068152, 739175, 76598, '<td valign="top">technically a strong image, but the message isn''t appealing to me</td>', 'technically a strong image, but the message isn''t appealing to me', '2008-11-17 15:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5068158, 739698, 42013, '<td valign="top">great processing. Looks like someone walked out in front of you and spent a few seconds admiring your artwork????</td>', 'great processing. Looks like someone walked out in front of you and spent a few seconds admiring your artwork????', '2008-11-17 15:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
