(5068234, 739664, 76598, '<td valign="top">To my eye it this comes across as very flat and not really appealing to view.  It might serve in a documentary type situation.</td>', 'To my eye it this comes across as very flat and not really appealing to view.  It might serve in a documentary type situation.', '2008-11-17 16:28:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5068236, 739626, 76598, '<td valign="top">Very nice, great water sheeting and color, the double heart is very effective.</td>', 'Very nice, great water sheeting and color, the double heart is very effective.', '2008-11-17 16:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5068238, 738903, 76598, '<td valign="top">OK, shoehorn, but I am not going to penalize you :)  I find the image very busy and not really conveying a message or entertaining the eye or mind.</td>', 'OK, shoehorn, but I am not going to penalize you :)  I find the image very busy and not really conveying a message or entertaining the eye or mind.', '2008-11-17 16:29:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5068241, 739484, 76598, '<td valign="top">You got the title right, I really like this for its color and abstractness.  There are some strong images in this challenge, so I don''t see a ribbon for this, but you will do well.</td>', 'You got the title right, I really like this for its color and abstractness.  There are some strong images in this challenge, so I don''t see a ribbon for this, but you will do well.', '2008-11-17 16:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5068245, 739540, 76598, '<td valign="top">The image is too flat, lack of contrast, lack of visual interest and anything to bring you into the image.</td>', 'The image is too flat, lack of contrast, lack of visual interest and anything to bring you into the image.', '2008-11-17 16:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5068246, 739714, 76598, '<td valign="top">So, is it food?  The processing...I assume...is a little too much for my tastes, too abstract.</td>', 'So, is it food?  The processing...I assume...is a little too much for my tastes, too abstract.', '2008-11-17 16:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5068248, 739587, 76598, '<td valign="top">Interesting, the composition draws you in, but if you were take away the frame, I am not sure what you are left with....??  A lot of photoshop in this.</td>', 'Interesting, the composition draws you in, but if you were take away the frame, I am not sure what you are left with....??  A lot of photoshop in this.', '2008-11-17 16:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5068253, 739198, 76598, '<td valign="top">And I am sure she likes this picture.  Very nice image and I really like the hearts.  If somehow you could bring more of her face into the image it would be nice....it is a little stark in the transition on the left side.</td>', 'And I am sure she likes this picture.  Very nice image and I really like the hearts.  If somehow you could bring more of her face into the image it would be nice....it is a little stark in the transition on the left side.', '2008-11-17 16:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5068259, 739598, 76598, '<td valign="top">I knew someone would have this, a little more light and a little less shadowing would have rung by bell more.</td>', 'I knew someone would have this, a little more light and a little less shadowing would have rung by bell more.', '2008-11-17 16:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5068262, 739672, 76598, '<td valign="top">Very simple image, but VERY effective.  I really like the colors, positioning, and effective use of DOF.  My only complaint is the glare in the background fold to the left.  I might have been tempted to crop the left a little to remove some of that.  Whatever you did around the heart is great as well.</td>', 'Very simple image, but VERY effective.  I really like the colors, positioning, and effective use of DOF.  My only complaint is the glare in the background fold to the left.  I might have been tempted to crop the left a little to remove some of that.  Whatever you did around the heart is great as well.', '2008-11-17 16:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5068264, 739413, 76598, '<td valign="top">Interesting image, I think the subject will appreciate the image in a few years.  Good exposure, nice composition, good DOF.  The piercing works in the image, but doesn''t appeal to me.</td>', 'Interesting image, I think the subject will appreciate the image in a few years.  Good exposure, nice composition, good DOF.  The piercing works in the image, but doesn''t appeal to me.', '2008-11-17 16:38:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5068265, 739671, 76598, '<td valign="top">Nice attempt, but it comes across as flat and not really visually appealing.</td>', 'Nice attempt, but it comes across as flat and not really visually appealing.', '2008-11-17 16:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5068267, 739229, 76598, '<td valign="top">Well, this is a different take on the subject.  Technically very strong, composition is good, but the subject just doesn''t appeal to me.</td>', 'Well, this is a different take on the subject.  Technically very strong, composition is good, but the subject just doesn''t appeal to me.', '2008-11-17 16:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5068269, 739300, 76598, '<td valign="top">Nice, I like the colors and feel of it, I think a bit larger heart in the center would have been nice and I feel that the processing has made the frame less appealing than it could have been.</td>', 'Nice, I like the colors and feel of it, I think a bit larger heart in the center would have been nice and I feel that the processing has made the frame less appealing than it could have been.', '2008-11-17 16:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5068278, 739711, 76598, '<td valign="top">Having no experience....is this Viagra?  Interesting image, the reflections are good, but you have the same problems I have had with litter on the glass.  Not sure that the image is all that appealing.</td>', 'Having no experience....is this Viagra?  Interesting image, the reflections are good, but you have the same problems I have had with litter on the glass.  Not sure that the image is all that appealing.', '2008-11-17 16:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5068281, 739723, 76598, '<td valign="top">Not sure what is happening here, is there water?  The odd positioning of colors and light shading changes just aren''t appealing to me.  I am assuming it is meant to be abstract, but it feels like a photographic failure.</td>', 'Not sure what is happening here, is there water?  The odd positioning of colors and light shading changes just aren''t appealing to me.  I am assuming it is meant to be abstract, but it feels like a photographic failure.', '2008-11-17 16:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5068285, 739717, 76598, '<td valign="top">Is the answer a HEART? Maybe that''s what is lacking....  The picture is funny and says a lot, but I fear you may get dinged for this one.  Glad I wasn''t in that race!</td>', 'Is the answer a HEART? Maybe that''s what is lacking....  The picture is funny and says a lot, but I fear you may get dinged for this one.  Glad I wasn''t in that race!', '2008-11-17 16:45:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5068286, 739479, 76598, '<td valign="top">I like this, like the composition, like the color tone, nice background, it appears a little blown out on the lower right</td>', 'I like this, like the composition, like the color tone, nice background, it appears a little blown out on the lower right', '2008-11-17 16:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5068288, 738997, 76598, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and it conveys a reflective tone, but I am not sure that it is terribly visually appealing to me and feels a little over processed.  What is happening with her nail color???</td>', 'Nice composition and it conveys a reflective tone, but I am not sure that it is terribly visually appealing to me and feels a little over processed.  What is happening with her nail color???', '2008-11-17 16:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5068292, 739247, 76598, '<td valign="top">Great color on the leaf, the image as a whole feels really dark and there is a lack of connection (emotionally) between the heart she is holding and the lady.</td>', 'Great color on the leaf, the image as a whole feels really dark and there is a lack of connection (emotionally) between the heart she is holding and the lady.', '2008-11-17 16:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5068293, 738054, 76598, '<td valign="top">I like the way they dangle and the composition,  for me the image lacks depth and doesn''t hold me....just don''t know who to express it beyond that.</td>', 'I like the way they dangle and the composition,  for me the image lacks depth and doesn''t hold me....just don''t know who to express it beyond that.', '2008-11-17 16:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5068294, 739715, 76598, '<td valign="top">I like this, I would like it more if the fence weren''t there, being closer to the couple with a wider lens to still get the city would have improved it.</td>', 'I like this, I would like it more if the fence weren''t there, being closer to the couple with a wider lens to still get the city would have improved it.', '2008-11-17 16:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
