(5068390, 739665, 62671, '<td valign="top">I have no clue what the red thing is.  The drip is white which contrasts nicely with the red thing.  The title, though innocent it may be, makes me want to go ew.  There is a lot of other things reflected in the red thing that is a bit distracting to the image.  something that needs to be shot in a light tent to control those side reflections.</td>', 'I have no clue what the red thing is.  The drip is white which contrasts nicely with the red thing.  The title, though innocent it may be, makes me want to go ew.  There is a lot of other things reflected in the red thing that is a bit distracting to the image.  something that needs to be shot in a light tent to control those side reflections.', '2008-11-17 17:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5068394, 739565, 62671, '<td valign="top">I love this concept image!  Very well thought out and well executed. <br/>This would have been so adorable with baby feet.  But its nicely done.  The ragged jeans work well too.  The lighting and style suggests one of the toos shot this image.  If its not,  take it as a compliment.  ;) I predict this is a ribboner.  (possibly the blue)</td>', 'I love this concept image!  Very well thought out and well executed. This would have been so adorable with baby feet.  But its nicely done.  The ragged jeans work well too.  The lighting and style suggests one of the toos shot this image.  If its not,  take it as a compliment.  ;) I predict this is a ribboner.  (possibly the blue)', '2008-11-17 17:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5068404, 739626, 62671, '<td valign="top">The yellows aren''t orange enough.  This is an excellent time for complimentary color scheme.  The yellow just seems to be a little bland against the strong blue.  I like the band of blue dividing the yellow in two, but its also a bit bland.  Maybe a half neutral density filter would have given more saturation in the upper part of the image, but Im not sure. <br/>Another option is to crop just below the water for more impact on the heart. <br/>I would have chosen to crop at the waist of the little kid.  Just give a suggestion of the people playing in the water beyond.  But thats a personal choice.  The focus on the heart is great.  But there are a lot of artifacts in the water that I would have cleaned up.  This is advanced so I would have taken advantage of that.  I wouldn''t remove the ripples but the black specks.</td>', 'The yellows aren''t orange enough.  This is an excellent time for complimentary color scheme.  The yellow just seems to be a little bland against the strong blue.  I like the band of blue dividing the yellow in two, but its also a bit bland.  Maybe a half neutral density filter would have given more saturation in the upper part of the image, but Im not sure. Another option is to crop just below the water for more impact on the heart. I would have chosen to crop at the waist of the little kid.  Just give a suggestion of the people playing in the water beyond.  But thats a personal choice.  The focus on the heart is great.  But there are a lot of artifacts in the water that I would have cleaned up.  This is advanced so I would have taken advantage of that.  I wouldn''t remove the ripples but the black specks.', '2008-11-17 17:47:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5068409, 739488, 62671, '<td valign="top">My first impression is that it was dark.  It doesn''t look like photography, more like a graphic design.  This looks pretty difficult to achieve photographically.  I''m guessing its paper with some special lighting to make it glow.  Its intriguing.</td>', 'My first impression is that it was dark.  It doesn''t look like photography, more like a graphic design.  This looks pretty difficult to achieve photographically.  I''m guessing its paper with some special lighting to make it glow.  Its intriguing.', '2008-11-17 17:51:03.000000', NULL, 1),
