(5068453, 739668, 62671, '<td valign="top">First impression - Yikes! ''hell hath no fury like a woman scorned''  <br/>Technicals - The red hair of the model competes for attention with the red of the heart.  So my eye then rests on the black of the knife handle.  The white dot on the handle grabs my attention away from the black dots of the eyes.  They are along the same plane.  The focus seems to be on the heart but its slightly off the mark.  I would like to see something more sharp. <br/>The strong whites in the front overpower the background.  I would have loved to see the back the same brightness and without shadows/texture as the front to make the details pop more.</td>', 'First impression - Yikes! ''hell hath no fury like a woman scorned''  Technicals - The red hair of the model competes for attention with the red of the heart.  So my eye then rests on the black of the knife handle.  The white dot on the handle grabs my attention away from the black dots of the eyes.  They are along the same plane.  The focus seems to be on the heart but its slightly off the mark.  I would like to see something more sharp. The strong whites in the front overpower the background.  I would have loved to see the back the same brightness and without shadows/texture as the front to make the details pop more.', '2008-11-17 18:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
