(5069889, 739715, 99411, '<td valign="top">A fantastic shot that I would certainly hang on my wall.  Would be a 10 from me if it wasn''t shoehorned into this challenge by a smart title.  Will watch with interest on it''s final position</td>', 'A fantastic shot that I would certainly hang on my wall.  Would be a 10 from me if it wasn''t shoehorned into this challenge by a smart title.  Will watch with interest on it''s final position', '2008-11-18 17:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
