(5079061, 739676, 19959, '<td valign="top">excellent... very effective</td>', 'excellent... very effective', '2008-11-22 11:03:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5079062, 739510, 19959, '<td valign="top">This should appeal to the DPC voters... top 3 IMO</td>', 'This should appeal to the DPC voters... top 3 IMO', '2008-11-22 11:03:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5079063, 739689, 19959, '<td valign="top">obvious choice for the challenge. But this effort is the best of this type... great work.</td>', 'obvious choice for the challenge. But this effort is the best of this type... great work.', '2008-11-22 11:04:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5079064, 738844, 19959, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot... great work</td>', 'I like this a lot... great work', '2008-11-22 11:04:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5079065, 739698, 19959, '<td valign="top">Good idea... nice to see a bit of effort in the challenge. This idea could have been even stronger with a better composition though (IMO) also a slower shutter if possible....  makes me want to go and try something similar...</td>', 'Good idea... nice to see a bit of effort in the challenge. This idea could have been even stronger with a better composition though (IMO) also a slower shutter if possible....  makes me want to go and try something similar...', '2008-11-22 11:06:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5079066, 739583, 19959, '<td valign="top">interesting</td>', 'interesting', '2008-11-22 11:06:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5079067, 739688, 19959, '<td valign="top">This is excellent, should do very well</td>', 'This is excellent, should do very well', '2008-11-22 11:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5079069, 738054, 19959, '<td valign="top">excellent..</td>', 'excellent..', '2008-11-22 11:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5079070, 739664, 19959, '<td valign="top">excellent photo. very nice work</td>', 'excellent photo. very nice work', '2008-11-22 11:07:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5079075, 739628, 76430, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty, abstract looking shot, but it''s hard to score based on the challenge and title.  Is it really a picture of heartburn?  It looks like one of those late 60''s overhead projector water and oil psychedelic displays.</td>', 'This is a pretty, abstract looking shot, but it''s hard to score based on the challenge and title.  Is it really a picture of heartburn?  It looks like one of those late 60''s overhead projector water and oil psychedelic displays.', '2008-11-22 11:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5079110, 739634, 68599, '<td valign="top">Sherpet? Very nice composition :)</td>', 'Sherpet? Very nice composition :)', '2008-11-22 11:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5079112, 739668, 68599, '<td valign="top">Quite scary :p I don''t know if the gaussian blur effect really works with this kinda image, but it''s quite interesting.</td>', 'Quite scary :p I don''t know if the gaussian blur effect really works with this kinda image, but it''s quite interesting.', '2008-11-22 11:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5079116, 739527, 68599, '<td valign="top">Custy... :P</td>', 'Custy... :P', '2008-11-22 12:00:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5079117, 739543, 68599, '<td valign="top">Very creative :)</td>', 'Very creative :)', '2008-11-22 12:00:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5079119, 739609, 68599, '<td valign="top">gruesome, but so far my favourite in the challenge. 8</td>', 'gruesome, but so far my favourite in the challenge. 8', '2008-11-22 12:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5079290, 739713, 43774, '<td valign="top">I like this. With a heart on her lips you would think this would be a fun image but her eyes and the lighting make you wonder. A good portrait that makes you think.</td>', 'I like this. With a heart on her lips you would think this would be a fun image but her eyes and the lighting make you wonder. A good portrait that makes you think.', '2008-11-22 16:05:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5079291, 739372, 43774, '<td valign="top">Great colours, very bright. The dark shadow across the top of the leaf is a bit of a distraction.</td>', 'Great colours, very bright. The dark shadow across the top of the leaf is a bit of a distraction.', '2008-11-22 16:06:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5079292, 739671, 43774, '<td valign="top">Cute setup and very well lit.</td>', 'Cute setup and very well lit.', '2008-11-22 16:06:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5079293, 739557, 43774, '<td valign="top">Good lighting, nice setup,a  bit grainy. All in all a good photo.</td>', 'Good lighting, nice setup,a  bit grainy. All in all a good photo.', '2008-11-22 16:07:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5079294, 739686, 43774, '<td valign="top">I like the shadow, I like the placement of the statue. Not so sure about the rings being used as halos. But overall a good photo.</td>', 'I like the shadow, I like the placement of the statue. Not so sure about the rings being used as halos. But overall a good photo.', '2008-11-22 16:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5079295, 739719, 43774, '<td valign="top">Cool painting with light, I like how the glass is blue but the heart is red.</td>', 'Cool painting with light, I like how the glass is blue but the heart is red.', '2008-11-22 16:08:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5079296, 739370, 43774, '<td valign="top">Cute, a different take on the "object reflected in a water drop shot". I like the drops along the stem a lot better than the one dripping from the tip of the rose.</td>', 'Cute, a different take on the "object reflected in a water drop shot". I like the drops along the stem a lot better than the one dripping from the tip of the rose.', '2008-11-22 16:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5079298, 739714, 43774, '<td valign="top">.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-11-18 16:21:10.</i></td>', '.', '2008-11-22 16:10:04.000000', '2009-11-18 16:21:10.000000', 1),
(5079299, 739698, 43774, '<td valign="top">I like the movement, creative.</td>', 'I like the movement, creative.', '2008-11-22 16:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5079300, 739689, 43774, '<td valign="top">Been done before but who cares.....this is nice!</td>', 'Been done before but who cares.....this is nice!', '2008-11-22 16:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5079301, 738835, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very nice, might have tried a different composition so the heart was a bit further away from the center. I love the ripples of the waves.</td>', 'Very nice, might have tried a different composition so the heart was a bit further away from the center. I love the ripples of the waves.', '2008-11-22 16:11:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5079303, 739543, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very nice, are they suspended from string? Good lighting.</td>', 'Very nice, are they suspended from string? Good lighting.', '2008-11-22 16:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5079305, 739629, 43774, '<td valign="top">A bit too dark and contrasty for my tastes, overall not bad.</td>', 'A bit too dark and contrasty for my tastes, overall not bad.', '2008-11-22 16:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5079306, 739247, 43774, '<td valign="top">Cute, a bit dark.</td>', 'Cute, a bit dark.', '2008-11-22 16:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5079307, 739531, 43774, '<td valign="top">I like the filter and reflection, I don''t like the out of focus heart in the front.</td>', 'I like the filter and reflection, I don''t like the out of focus heart in the front.', '2008-11-22 16:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5079308, 739386, 76430, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp city shot.  It''s a different aspect of heart.  What are the light splotches above the city, distant lights, noise, or what?  I would suggest selecting the whole dark "sky" part and reduce brightness to get rid of it.</td>', 'Nice sharp city shot.  It''s a different aspect of heart.  What are the light splotches above the city, distant lights, noise, or what?  I would suggest selecting the whole dark "sky" part and reduce brightness to get rid of it.', '2008-11-22 16:13:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5079310, 739580, 43774, '<td valign="top">Cute but not overly fond of the heart shaped border/vignette.</td>', 'Cute but not overly fond of the heart shaped border/vignette.', '2008-11-22 16:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5079311, 738997, 43774, '<td valign="top">I''m not a big fan of this type of processing that gives everything a green cast, but I really like this photo. Love her gaze and pose.</td>', 'I''m not a big fan of this type of processing that gives everything a green cast, but I really like this photo. Love her gaze and pose.', '2008-11-22 16:14:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5079312, 739718, 43774, '<td valign="top">Robert? Looks like a signature <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=8891" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">banmorn</a> shot. Very colourful.</td>', 'Robert? Looks like a signature  banmorn shot. Very colourful.', '2008-11-22 16:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5079314, 739664, 43774, '<td valign="top">Dark and grainy which normally portrays a mood the opposite of love, so this definitely makes you think.</td>', 'Dark and grainy which normally portrays a mood the opposite of love, so this definitely makes you think.', '2008-11-22 16:16:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5079315, 738054, 43774, '<td valign="top">Have never seen purple leaves and berries before, I assume the colour has been altered? It''s a cute photo, a bit grainy.</td>', 'Have never seen purple leaves and berries before, I assume the colour has been altered? It''s a cute photo, a bit grainy.', '2008-11-22 16:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5079316, 739591, 43774, '<td valign="top">Hearts and dots, cute.</td>', 'Hearts and dots, cute.', '2008-11-22 16:17:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5079317, 739672, 43774, '<td valign="top">Even Woody falls in love I guess. Cute.</td>', 'Even Woody falls in love I guess. Cute.', '2008-11-22 16:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5079318, 739229, 43774, '<td valign="top">Lots of elements here to make you think. A cross, pills, a purse saying live to love, love to live. This tells a sad story.</td>', 'Lots of elements here to make you think. A cross, pills, a purse saying live to love, love to live. This tells a sad story.', '2008-11-22 16:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5079319, 739461, 43774, '<td valign="top">This is cute but she looks a bit wary or nervous.</td>', 'This is cute but she looks a bit wary or nervous.', '2008-11-22 16:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5079320, 739667, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very good lighting, cute bears. I would have taken the tags off, but then it would be harder to tie this into a heart challenge.</td>', 'Very good lighting, cute bears. I would have taken the tags off, but then it would be harder to tie this into a heart challenge.', '2008-11-22 16:20:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5079321, 739566, 43774, '<td valign="top">Lighting is a bit bright but it''s a cute concept.</td>', 'Lighting is a bit bright but it''s a cute concept.', '2008-11-22 16:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5079322, 739690, 43774, '<td valign="top">I like that necklace. The lighting makes this mysterious.</td>', 'I like that necklace. The lighting makes this mysterious.', '2008-11-22 16:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5079323, 739619, 43774, '<td valign="top">Good DOF here.</td>', 'Good DOF here.', '2008-11-22 16:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5079326, 739614, 43774, '<td valign="top">What an interesting work of art. Very good lighting.</td>', 'What an interesting work of art. Very good lighting.', '2008-11-22 16:22:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5079492, 739681, 81362, '<td valign="top">Took a while to grasp the implied heart shape inside the curled tube. Very artistic.</td>', 'Took a while to grasp the implied heart shape inside the curled tube. Very artistic.', '2008-11-22 20:36:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5079757, 739516, 48248, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to have seen a wider DOF so "Bradley" would be more in focus.  I like the lighting, though</td>', 'I would have liked to have seen a wider DOF so "Bradley" would be more in focus.  I like the lighting, though', '2008-11-23 06:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5079759, 739665, 48248, '<td valign="top">Creative concept, However, the fact that your lighting setup shows, really distracts from this image for me.</td>', 'Creative concept, However, the fact that your lighting setup shows, really distracts from this image for me.', '2008-11-23 06:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5079760, 739630, 48248, '<td valign="top">I like your intrepretation.  I would suggest removing all the clutter and focusing just on the main subject.</td>', 'I like your intrepretation.  I would suggest removing all the clutter and focusing just on the main subject.', '2008-11-23 06:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5079761, 739488, 48248, '<td valign="top">Simple, nice composition, great lighting</td>', 'Simple, nice composition, great lighting', '2008-11-23 06:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5079762, 738903, 48248, '<td valign="top">I think this would have been more effective if you got alot closer and just had the heads.</td>', 'I think this would have been more effective if you got alot closer and just had the heads.', '2008-11-23 06:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5079763, 739586, 48248, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, but the composition seems somewhat flat to me.</td>', 'Nice lighting, but the composition seems somewhat flat to me.', '2008-11-23 06:54:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5079764, 739634, 48248, '<td valign="top">You obviously put alot of work into this one.  However, the composition is static.  Maybe if it were shot from a different perspective?</td>', 'You obviously put alot of work into this one.  However, the composition is static.  Maybe if it were shot from a different perspective?', '2008-11-23 06:57:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5079767, 739702, 48248, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  The only problem I have is the females profile.  I''m assuming that''s her elbow sticking out of her face, but it makes her look like a baboon.  Actually, his elbow makes it look like he has a growth on his back.  This would have been a 10 for me, otherwise,</td>', 'Nicely done.  The only problem I have is the females profile.  I''m assuming that''s her elbow sticking out of her face, but it makes her look like a baboon.  Actually, his elbow makes it look like he has a growth on his back.  This would have been a 10 for me, otherwise,', '2008-11-23 07:04:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5079769, 739614, 48248, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting and composition</td>', 'Very nice lighting and composition', '2008-11-23 07:06:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5079770, 739676, 48248, '<td valign="top">Very Nice!!!!</td>', 'Very Nice!!!!', '2008-11-23 07:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5079790, 739586, 100343, '<td valign="top">I like the use of shadows. Simple but effective!</td>', 'I like the use of shadows. Simple but effective!', '2008-11-23 08:59:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5079792, 739719, 100343, '<td valign="top">I love light graffiti and you have used it effectively in this picture</td>', 'I love light graffiti and you have used it effectively in this picture', '2008-11-23 09:01:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5079793, 739613, 100343, '<td valign="top">The vibrant colours stand out well. The b &amp; w pencils help focus my attention on the heart</td>', 'The vibrant colours stand out well. The b & w pencils help focus my attention on the heart', '2008-11-23 09:03:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5079795, 739543, 100343, '<td valign="top">Very bold - stands out well against the black background. Would have been even better if there had been thirteen cards used not fourteen! =)</td>', 'Very bold - stands out well against the black background. Would have been even better if there had been thirteen cards used not fourteen! =)', '2008-11-23 09:05:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5079798, 739697, 100343, '<td valign="top">I love the old and new aspect of this photograph. Lighting adds a nice mood to it</td>', 'I love the old and new aspect of this photograph. Lighting adds a nice mood to it', '2008-11-23 09:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5079803, 739175, 100343, '<td valign="top">Slightly twisted interpretation on the theme - overall a very clever photograph!</td>', 'Slightly twisted interpretation on the theme - overall a very clever photograph!', '2008-11-23 09:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5080036, 739667, 62671, '<td valign="top">Those whites are fantastic.  They look so soft and plushy.  <br/>Nicely done!</td>', 'Those whites are fantastic.  They look so soft and plushy.  Nicely done!', '2008-11-23 14:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5080037, 739628, 62671, '<td valign="top">Interesting image.  The colors realy fit the title well.  Great conceptual image.</td>', 'Interesting image.  The colors realy fit the title well.  Great conceptual image.', '2008-11-23 14:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5080040, 739600, 62671, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure the ''story'' of the image but it is technically well done.</td>', 'I''m not sure the ''story'' of the image but it is technically well done.', '2008-11-23 14:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5080053, 739625, 62671, '<td valign="top">Its nearly impossible to see the hand mirror.   It doesn''t really need to be in the image.  Its a bit distracting from the subject.  If the necklace was the only item in the image it would have more impact for me.</td>', 'Its nearly impossible to see the hand mirror.   It doesn''t really need to be in the image.  Its a bit distracting from the subject.  If the necklace was the only item in the image it would have more impact for me.', '2008-11-23 14:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5080067, 739670, 62671, '<td valign="top">Exposure seems to be a bit off, the heart is a little to neon, and the composition could have been better.  If the paper completely filled the frame, you wouldn''t have the dark area that has a touch of noise.  The shredded edge pulls my eye away as well as the fact the lines are fighting with the heart for dominance.  It would have been cute to have ''circle yes or no'' written in a childs hand.</td>', 'Exposure seems to be a bit off, the heart is a little to neon, and the composition could have been better.  If the paper completely filled the frame, you wouldn''t have the dark area that has a touch of noise.  The shredded edge pulls my eye away as well as the fact the lines are fighting with the heart for dominance.  It would have been cute to have ''circle yes or no'' written in a childs hand.', '2008-11-23 14:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5080069, 739718, 62671, '<td valign="top">I love this shot!  I predict this one to be a ribboner.</td>', 'I love this shot!  I predict this one to be a ribboner.', '2008-11-23 14:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5080071, 739479, 62671, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and the smoothness of the paper really forces the colors to pop.   The hot area in the lower right corner is the only nitpick.</td>', 'I like the colors and the smoothness of the paper really forces the colors to pop.   The hot area in the lower right corner is the only nitpick.', '2008-11-23 14:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5080075, 739616, 62671, '<td valign="top">I like the cool colorizing.  The background is a bit busy for me.  The mirrored tiles do stand out from it though.</td>', 'I like the cool colorizing.  The background is a bit busy for me.  The mirrored tiles do stand out from it though.', '2008-11-23 14:27:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5080078, 739386, 62671, '<td valign="top">What a view!   Only thing I would suggest is shooting this scene with a slight bit of light in the sky.  Either twilight or dusk.  the red sign grabs my attention.  So much going on.</td>', 'What a view!   Only thing I would suggest is shooting this scene with a slight bit of light in the sky.  Either twilight or dusk.  the red sign grabs my attention.  So much going on.', '2008-11-23 14:29:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5080082, 739698, 62671, '<td valign="top">I like that the person holding the heart is wearing black to blend in the background.  the action blur of the city really makes this image!  One of my favorites, it should be a ribboner.</td>', 'I like that the person holding the heart is wearing black to blend in the background.  the action blur of the city really makes this image!  One of my favorites, it should be a ribboner.', '2008-11-23 14:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5080087, 739677, 62671, '<td valign="top">Fabulous! Everything about it is just right!</td>', 'Fabulous! Everything about it is just right!', '2008-11-23 14:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5080093, 738997, 62671, '<td valign="top">This type of coloring really is popular now.  Great eyes!   the hearts are a bit of a secondary element not exactly the subject.  I like the pose and the title fits the image well.  The red does jump off the image.   I like the color the nails match the lips.</td>', 'This type of coloring really is popular now.  Great eyes!   the hearts are a bit of a secondary element not exactly the subject.  I like the pose and the title fits the image well.  The red does jump off the image.   I like the color the nails match the lips.', '2008-11-23 14:34:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5080098, 739510, 62671, '<td valign="top">Nice icey blues.  I like the textures in the ice even though your probably getting a lot of advice on how to get ice without bubbles.  I like it.</td>', 'Nice icey blues.  I like the textures in the ice even though your probably getting a lot of advice on how to get ice without bubbles.  I like it.', '2008-11-23 14:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5080101, 739562, 62671, '<td valign="top">I like the coloring and the texture but the blur is distracting on this image.  It seems to not have much in focus if anything.   Something should be sharp in an image like this.</td>', 'I like the coloring and the texture but the blur is distracting on this image.  It seems to not have much in focus if anything.   Something should be sharp in an image like this.', '2008-11-23 14:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5080105, 739666, 62671, '<td valign="top">This is interesting.   The shadow lines contrast with the geometrical shapes of the bubbles.  The heart shape isn''t really obvious.</td>', 'This is interesting.   The shadow lines contrast with the geometrical shapes of the bubbles.  The heart shape isn''t really obvious.', '2008-11-23 14:38:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5080110, 739465, 62671, '<td valign="top">Great sky.  The tree is the main focus of this composition.  Interesting framing but its not something I prefer.</td>', 'Great sky.  The tree is the main focus of this composition.  Interesting framing but its not something I prefer.', '2008-11-23 14:40:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5080112, 739540, 62671, '<td valign="top">Creative!  I like the icey blue tones.</td>', 'Creative!  I like the icey blue tones.', '2008-11-23 14:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
