(5080128, 739690, 62671, '<td valign="top">I like the selective color, the composition is great.  I little lift on the breast would have given a more socially desirable shape.  I do appreciate the age of woman and the beauty within.   The lighting couldn''t have been better on the face  but its a bit to hot on the breast.</td>', 'I like the selective color, the composition is great.  I little lift on the breast would have given a more socially desirable shape.  I do appreciate the age of woman and the beauty within.   The lighting couldn''t have been better on the face  but its a bit to hot on the breast.', '2008-11-23 14:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5080130, 739372, 62671, '<td valign="top">Great backlit heart shaped leaf.  I like the background as well.  The branches cutting through is a distraction.</td>', 'Great backlit heart shaped leaf.  I like the background as well.  The branches cutting through is a distraction.', '2008-11-23 14:51:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5080139, 739539, 62671, '<td valign="top">Took me a while to figure out that the image inside is a piston.  Most probably wont get what the object is.  (guys probably will)   The message is well understood though.   I think this idea has potential.  But it has some minor issues that could be refined.   The ''hole'' looks odd, the shadows are harsh and the hot spot on the top right is distracting.   I like the texture in the oil can and the black and white coloring.</td>', 'Took me a while to figure out that the image inside is a piston.  Most probably wont get what the object is.  (guys probably will)   The message is well understood though.   I think this idea has potential.  But it has some minor issues that could be refined.   The ''hole'' looks odd, the shadows are harsh and the hot spot on the top right is distracting.   I like the texture in the oil can and the black and white coloring.', '2008-11-23 14:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5080143, 739160, 62671, '<td valign="top">This looks underexposed.  Great idea and composition. Would have been cute with the word heart in the letters in the image.</td>', 'This looks underexposed.  Great idea and composition. Would have been cute with the word heart in the letters in the image.', '2008-11-23 14:58:03.000000', NULL, 1),
