(5080151, 739313, 62671, '<td valign="top">Lovely landscape.  HDR is so in, this should do well.  I am not real crazy for it.  It has a cartoonish quality when its overdone.  Most overdo it.  This is on the verge of being overdone.   I like the color in the water.  It is what attracts my attention the most.   I do see the heart in the mountian so it fits well.</td>', 'Lovely landscape.  HDR is so in, this should do well.  I am not real crazy for it.  It has a cartoonish quality when its overdone.  Most overdo it.  This is on the verge of being overdone.   I like the color in the water.  It is what attracts my attention the most.   I do see the heart in the mountian so it fits well.', '2008-11-23 15:03:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5080154, 739711, 62671, '<td valign="top">I like the reflection and the fact the bottle is out of focus in the background.  the ''heart'' blends into the pile of pills unless you really look for it.   A separation would have improved this.</td>', 'I like the reflection and the fact the bottle is out of focus in the background.  the ''heart'' blends into the pile of pills unless you really look for it.   A separation would have improved this.', '2008-11-23 15:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
