(5081048, 739683, 28322, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Prash:</b></div><hr/><i> Beautiful and underrated, typical of some challanges. You got a 10 from me. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thank you Prash for your kind comment and encurragement, and thank you again for the 10.<br/>I was really dissapointed by the rating. I wasn''t looking forward to win the challange, but having t hose 1s 2s and 3s really put me down. Like if the entry is not relative to the challange. <br/>But once again, kind comments from kind people like yourself, makes me forget about it and continue .. <br/>Thanks for your kindness, highly appreciated, all the best, <br/>Ameed, <br/>Now to the next challange :)</td>', 'Originally posted by Prash: Beautiful and underrated, typical of some challanges. You got a 10 from me.   Thank you Prash for your kind comment and encurragement, and thank you again for the 10.I was really dissapointed by the rating. I wasn''t looking forward to win the challange, but having t hose 1s 2s and 3s really put me down. Like if the entry is not relative to the challange. But once again, kind comments from kind people like yourself, makes me forget about it and continue .. Thanks for your kindness, highly appreciated, all the best, Ameed, Now to the next challange :)', '2008-11-24 03:03:21.000000', NULL, 0),
