(5084310, 739626, 91614, '<td valign="top">I love this. Absolutely beautiful. I love the tones and colors. I was just browsing flickr and oddly enough i found this photo: <a href="//www.flickr.com/photos/lenlangevin/2862473235/" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//www.flickr.com/photos/lenlangevin/2862473235/</a>  which is weirdly similar. But i like this one much better. :) Awesome job.</td>', 'I love this. Absolutely beautiful. I love the tones and colors. I was just browsing flickr and oddly enough i found this photo: //www.flickr.com/photos/lenlangevin/2862473235/  which is weirdly similar. But i like this one much better. :) Awesome job.', '2008-11-25 22:13:44.000000', NULL, 0),
